{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788821927423908001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"deserved-rubidium-pussycat","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"f48a03960d8e5efb353a31bfd0e028e8391744e8d9be3d64b7014d05ac7be3ea","event_uuid":"2c20e03e-a32d-48e0-8b8e-cb1f0d4071b0","position":{"commit_sha":"8eef60402314cf66a537edabc329ea15d130ab1a","position":"1788816289632378477-2c20e03e-a32d-48e0-8b8e-cb1f0d4071b0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"a94a37d2ead2e6a1e300c7544330e2d156b0a76c8c52a6ed1afe48b4c159a5cf","event_uuid":"6fee6b0a-e20a-467a-98fe-9180b5a63d80","position":{"commit_sha":"421c75a058f87ef0f1b18a464d868ddcd90046b2","position":"1788816318696599912-6fee6b0a-e20a-467a-98fe-9180b5a63d80"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788816289632378477,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6fee6b0a-e20a-467a-98fe-9180b5a63d80","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"47be-ce45-484a-4cc2"}],"description":"## Problem\nGerrit rejects a valid review upload from a clean worktree with `remote unpack failed: error Missing tree 1959f268184dce88f62132173dfbf24e823ceb89`. The failure blocks comment-remediation changes from entering review and appears to be Gerrit repository/object-store health, not the patch.\n\n## Evidence\n- Worktree: `/Users/joeoakhart/comment-remediation-47be`.\n- Commit: `be29a0057028f539a34f79658fb57f09d40f0422`; parent and current `origin/main`: `710a606b6d38bafc0f2c6684711b08811d26529e`.\n- Normal upload `git push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main` was rejected before a change was created.\n- A second upload with `git push --no-thin gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main` failed with the identical missing-tree object.\n- Locally, `git cat-file -t 1959f268184dce88f62132173dfbf24e823ceb89` returns `tree`, and the leaf revision walk reports no missing objects.\n- No server-side repair or further retry was attempted in the comment/documentation session.\n\n## Investigation plan\n- Reproduce against the Gerrit repository and inspect the receive-pack/JGit logs for the rejected upload.\n- Verify Gerrit's `main` ref, reachable object graph, alternates/promisor configuration, recent replication, and repository consistency around the named tree.\n- Determine why a non-thin pack still leaves the server resolving the tree as missing.\n- Repair the server repository through the supported backup/recovery path, then verify ordinary review upload and receive-pack health.\n- Document the root cause, blast radius, safe recovery, and recurrence prevention.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The missing-tree rejection is reproduced or conclusively tied to retained server logs.\n- [ ] The precise Gerrit repository/object-store root cause is proven with concrete evidence.\n- [ ] Repository integrity is restored through a backed-up, supported recovery procedure.\n- [ ] A normal `HEAD:refs/for/main` review upload succeeds without `--no-thin`.\n- [ ] Existing refs/changes and `main` remain valid and no review data is lost.\n- [ ] Recovery and prevention evidence are recorded on this ticket.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["gerrit","infrastructure","git","blocking"],"ticket_id":"7744-3e35-b2c4-40c2","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Gerrit rejects review uploads with a missing tree","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2c20e03e-a32d-48e0-8b8e-cb1f0d4071b0","6fee6b0a-e20a-467a-98fe-9180b5a63d80"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788821927423908001,"uuid":"73ea1c16-1d38-4528-b22a-41f8aa57d0d9"}